            "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">THE PRIMARY SURVEY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">DR ABC — The universal first-response sequence</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"160\" width=\"900\" height=\"140\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"12\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"220\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"48\">D</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"210\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">DANGER</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"245\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Final scene check before touching the patient.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"278\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Smoke? Traffic? Aggressive person? Address first.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"320\" width=\"900\" height=\"180\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.15)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"12\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"380\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"48\">R</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"370\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">RESPONSE — AVPU</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"405\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Alert · Verbal · Pain · Unresponsive</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"440\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Tap shoulder, shout \"Are you okay?\"</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"475\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">No response = call 911 now.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"520\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.15)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"12\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"580\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"48\">A</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"570\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">AIRWAY</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"605\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Open it. Head-tilt, chin-lift maneuver.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"640\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Suspect spine injury? Use jaw-thrust instead.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"700\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.15)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"12\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"760\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"48\">B</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"750\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">BREATHING</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"785\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Look, listen, feel — no more than 10 seconds.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"820\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">No normal breathing = start CPR immediately.</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"880\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.15)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\" rx=\"12\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"940\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"48\">C</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"930\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"24\">CIRCULATION</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"965\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">Severe bleeding? Skin pale, gray, blue = shock.</text><text x=\"240\" y=\"1000\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Lay rescuers: don't delay CPR to check pulse (AHA 2020).</text></svg>",
